1794833354.306378 write(3</output/review.md>, "# Review (88eca75)\n\nIndependent review of incoming/investigator/candidates.md. Source read: XmlLoader.java, PropertyCacheFile.java, XmlLoaderTest.java. Runtime classes are prebuilt, not a fresh build of this revision. No upstream search (network disabled). No novelty claim. Issue #22562 excluded. No P0 established.\n\n## 1. SYSTEM external subset \342\200\224 mechanism confirmed, P3 refuted\n\nStatus: confirmed behavior; severity and vulnerability claim refuted.\n\nObserved source: XmlLoader.createXmlReader sets validating true (XmlLoader.java:115) after LoadExternalDtdFeatureProvider (114, 156-164). Default checkstyle.enableExternalDtdLoad=false sets the nonvalidating load-external-dtd feature and external-general-entities and external-parameter-entities to false (132-164). Comments 146-151 call outside files a security problem. resolveEntity (83-95) returns a classpath stream only for a mapped public id; otherwise null, so a SYSTEM id stays in force. XmlLoaderTest.java:55-62 only asserts an unmapped public id returns null"..., 3090) = 3090
